A wise doctor said to find the shirt of a happy man.
The king''s men looked everywhere.
At last, they found a happy man singing in a field.
But the happy man had no shirt at all!', '很久以前,一位国王有权有财,但他并不快乐。
一位智慧的医生说,去找一个快乐的人的衬衫。
国王的人到处寻找。
最后,他们找到了一个在田野里唱歌的快乐的人。
但这个快乐的人根本没有衬衫!', 'us_female', '[{"q": "Was the king happy?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["Sometimes.", "Yes.", "No.", "Always."]}, {"q": "What did the wise doctor say to find?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["The shirt of a happy man.", "A new palace.", "More money.", "A doctor."]}, {"q": "Where did they find the happy man?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Singing in a field.", "In a city.", "In a shop.", "In a palace."]}, {"q": "What did the happy man have?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["A new shirt.", "A red shirt.", "No shirt at all.", "Many shirts."]}, {"q": "What does the story teach?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["Shirts are nice.", "Doctors are wise.", "Wealth does not always bring happiness.", "Kings are happy."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', '9', 'U11');
