Soft, quiet music can make us feel calm.
Fast, loud music can make us feel excited.
Sad music can make some people cry.
Music is an important part of our lives.', '音乐对我们的情感有很强的影响。
轻柔安静的音乐能让我们感到平静。
快速响亮的音乐能让我们感到兴奋。
悲伤的音乐能让一些人哭泣。
音乐是我们生活中重要的一部分。', 'us_female', '[{"q": "What does music have a strong effect on?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Our age.", "Our height.", "Our money.", "Our feelings."]}, {"q": "What can soft, quiet music make us feel?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["Tired.", "Calm.", "Angry.", "Excited."]}, {"q": "What can fast, loud music make us feel?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Sad.", "Sleepy.", "Calm.", "Excited."]}, {"q": "What can sad music make some people do?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Dance.", "Sleep.", "Laugh.", "Cry."]}, {"q": "What is music according to the passage?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["Only for parties.", "A waste of time.", "An important part of our lives.", "Only for kids."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', '9', 'U11');
